f with crazy machines to be able to catch your dinner. \n\nThis game contains 5 different exciting and stunning interactive VR experiences:\n- Chase the Santa in an amazing Christmas adventure.\n- Equip yourself with a parachute and a massive fan then launch yourself from the huge catapult and try to catch your food\n- Get in a minecart and try out how dangerous the abandoned mine railways\n- Shoot out yourself from the huge cannon and use a wingsuit to steer yourself towards your target\n- Use a hang-glider to chase your dinner", "short_description": "Take a journey to an amazing cartoon world and equip yourself with crazy machines to be able to catch your dinner."}]}, "developer_name": "Technical Troupers", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tech-tro.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://tech-tro.com/privacy-policy", "publisher_name": "Technical Troupers", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tech-tro.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "CASUAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "480056573669709"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162801_1436130413101779_6395371402286858240_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZG8SdRbthxUQ7kNvwFnaFYy&_nc_oc=AdqJRx2PtgHIsk-6CSIGpVigFrA4486zJv5Rjex-6gZjf5wkva1yG6fW4VFTyJyd50Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculu